s no storyline—the focus is purely on movement, rhythm, presence, and collective energy.\nLighting is natural or street-based (daylight or simple streetlights), keeping faces and surroundings clear, realistic, and fully readable, never overly cinematic or artificial.\nThe camera feels handheld and observational, alternating between medium-wide shots that capture the group and close-ups on the lead performer, reinforcing intimacy and realism.\nThe overall tone is honest, grounded, and raw, capturing hip-hop as a living street culture rather than a staged performance."],"AQbgLJ":["Recents"],"ARtcd5":["Video resolution should be between 720p and 1080p"],"ATc9uV":["Create your avatar from prompt."],"AUYALh":["Coming soon"],"AVRmj4":["Use high-quality footage that is in focus."],"AVursC":["You need to log in to like it."],"AWA6XY":["optional"],"AWe5jN":["To replace the video background, you need to enable Restyle Subject Only."],"AXTKv2":["Please select one main subject to maintain consistency across all scenes."],"AXnepB":["Life Services"],"AY_d5p":["Misinformation"],"A_nltc":["In the city afternoon, people stroll on the streets, have afternoon tea and chat outdoors; two teenagers ride bicycles weaving through the alleys, light and shadow flow across their faces, eventually merging into the city's crowd. The moving language of the camera makes the scenes full of vitality and a sense of life.16：9，30s， Pixar style."],"AaGp1b":["Describe the main benefit and target buyer to create a Spanish-language e-commerce ad."],"Aaxq-1":["Please upload an image first"],"AbJFvW":["Wait! Use Coupon \"",["couponCode"],"\" For \u003c0\u003e",["offPercent"],"%\u003c/0\u003e OFF on Yearly Plan!"],"AbJGtp":["Story Videos"],"Aefepu":["Prompt (Optional)"],"AhcW9s":["Enlarge image"],"AikYXv":["Enhance Prompt"],"Aikpcs":["Upload JPG/PNG/WEBP/BMP images up to 10MB, with a minimum width/height of ",["minUploadImgPixel"],"px."],"Aj4tou":["Facebook Cover"],"Ajc4TJ":["Erase"],"Alx2_L":["Open in new t