HnL":["Display colors and SKUs"],"BLvvoR":["Select Asset"],"BO1j9W":["banner"],"BP-9Xl":["Please upload a video with width and height no larger than ",["maxVideoPixel"],"px."],"BPF0hW":["Describe a Bible story, scripture theme, or faith reflection to create a warm Christian story video."],"BQukYF":["Indonesian"],"BR3FRR":["A high-fashion vogue dance music video set on a vast, minimalist indoor stage with classical architectural elements.\nThe space is open and uncluttered, featuring a large wooden or neutral-toned floor, tall walls, and subtle architectural symmetry, creating a calm yet monumental atmosphere.\nMultiple dancers are spread across the stage, each occupying their own space rather than forming a tight formation.\nA lead dancer commands the visual focus through precise vogue-inspired movement, combining sharp hand performance, sculptural arm lines, controlled floor work, and deliberate pauses.\nThe choreography feels conceptual and restrained, driven by posture, weight shifts, spatial awareness, and intentional stillness rather than speed or spectacle.\nMovements are clean, angular, and expressive, allowing each pose to fully land and resonate in the open space.\nLighting is soft but directional, evenly illuminating the stage while gently sculpting bodies and faces.\nThere are no flashy effects—light is used to define space, distance, and presence, keeping every dancer clearly visible against the subdued background.\nThe camera remains stable and observational, alternating between wide shots that emphasize scale and isolation, and medium shots that capture facial focus, hands, and body tension.\nThe mood is quietly powerful, contemporary, and refined, where elegance, control, and identity emerge through minimalism and movement."],"BSk0fJ":["Describe your blog theme, colors, and style to create a Tumblr banner with room for your avatar and title."],"BTHmuG":["Provide the theme, grid size, words or numbers, and colors to create a clear, playable bingo card."],"BWkhxj":["Describe mood, dark visuals, and performance setting to create a Billie Eilish-themed video."],"BYRfi2":["Drop to upload images"],"BYaGQa":["Denoise"],"BYhqrv":["Wes Anderson Style"],"BZGF9O":["Creative Artists"],"BZlM9a":["Brush Color"],"B_aV85":["A professional idol-style dance music video set on a clean, modern stage with a flat, unobstructed floor.\nThe background is dominated by a simple LED wall or large window-style backdrop, keeping the space bright, minimal, and distraction-free.\nFormation (Critical):\nThe group performs in a clear V-shaped formation, with one center member positioned at the front point of the V.\nAll dancers maintain tight spacing and strict symmetry, executing full-group synchronized choreography (perfect unison).\nFormation changes occur, but always resolve back into strong, centered, symmetrical group shapes.\nChoreography:\nThe dance emphasizes clean, precise idol choreography with sharp timing and unified energy.\nMovements are synchronized head-to-toe, featuring clear arm lines, controlled footwork, and strong rhythmic accents.\nNo freestyle, no individual breakouts—group unity and precision are the focus.\nCamera \u0026 Composition:\nThe camera remains mostly front-facing and stable, clearly framing the entire V formation.\nThe center member is always visually dominant, with balanced framing that keeps all members visible and aligned.\nOccasional subtle push-ins highlight key movement hits without breaking formation clarity.\nLighting:\nLighting is bright, even, and face-friendly, optimized for clean visibility and sharp movement cut points.\nNo dramatic shadows—lighting supports choreography clarity and symmetry.\nOverall Style \u0026 Mood:\nProfessional, polished, and highly commercial.\nCamera-friendly, performance-focused, and unmistakably idol-style—clean lines, strong formations, and confident group presence."],"Ba33Os":["Delete Character"],"BawXMM":["Upload videos"],"Baz3rA":["Virtual Try-On Video"],"BbCk2b":["